## Frequently Asked Questions

{% faq
   title="Data Model FAQ"
   items=[
     {"question": "How do I add a new field to an existing table?", "answer": "Add the field to your schema file, run drizzle:generate to create a migration, then drizzle:migrate to apply it. For required fields on existing data, either make it nullable with a default, or run a data migration first."},
     {"question": "Why cache() on loader functions?", "answer": "React's cache() deduplicates calls during a single render. If multiple components call loadBoards(), the database query runs once. This is request-scoped, not persistent caching. It prevents unnecessary duplicate queries."}
   ]
/%}

